  "bodyHash": "5+jEB3gB1hs=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供眾多活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">隱藏合成配方書是一款簡單的客戶端模組，可以切換所有合成介面中配方按鈕的可見性。它不需要安裝在伺服器端。包含幾個設定選項，用於控制何時發送訊息以及停用功能。同時也適用於熔爐介面。<br><br>擁有一個快捷鍵（預設為 Tab），可以切換配方按鈕的可見性。在顯示合成網格時按下即可生效。它與玩家列表使用相同的快捷鍵，但兩者不會互相干擾。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/client.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldHideRecipeBook</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在客戶端首次啟動時隱藏合成配方書。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>allowRecipeBookToggleHotkey</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否允許使用快捷鍵切換合成配方書的可見性。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showMessageOnRecipeBookToggle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否在合成配方書顯示/隱藏時發送訊息。</span></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>功能展示：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>快捷鍵（預設為 Tab）：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"909\" height=\"508\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>按下快捷鍵後：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/hidden-recipe-book/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"524\" height=\"496\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模組包中自由使用此模組，只要下載仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模組的概覽和更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">留言功能已停用，因為我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上追蹤它們。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
